# CUTLASS CUP 2P versus: player 2 drives the right fighter with its own
# buttons (the keyboard splits). A player may go past the centre up to the
# line just in front of the rival's circle.
game cutlass
wait 5
cheat versus 1 4
expect versus == 1
expect np == 2
wait 2
cheat play
expect px1 == 262
hold P2DOWN 20
expect py1 > 110
hold RIGHT 20
expect px0 > 70
hold RIGHT 200
expect px0 == 244
hold P2LEFT 250
expect px1 == 76
